(text "LED driver is in AON; the relay contact sources EN only from the converter VIN.\nVIN=0 therefore cannot receive an AON logic HIGH. 22k holds EN LOW with relay open.\nBudget +100 mA AON for ten LEDs (worst corner); reserve 3 ms each for enable/disable propagation.\nMatrix clear remains direct hardware; optical relay latency applies to rail shutdown only." (at 15.24 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2ea5efd8-b244-4065-9379-011fcaf8e0de"))
